      "message": "\u003e It\u0027s just stating facts about libpldm that should be obvious (thus not need written down)\n\n\n\nThe entirety of this document contains things I consider obvious, but I\u0027ve written them down because quite clearly not all of them are obvious for many other contributors.\n\nIt\u0027s building a case for the position below.\n\nMy impression is you have quite some energy for the removal of these three relatively short sentences. I find your energy for that position moderately baffling. I feel I may be missing your fundamental opposition to them. What\u0027s the go?",
